2024 Nonprofit Capacity-Building Conference

**2-Day Training Event (Las Vegas, NV)**

**"Meet the MILLIONAIRE FAMILIES**

**who already give big gifts in your community.**

**" If you're responsible for fundraising, t**

**his 2-Day Event will be the most powerful nonprofit con**

**ference you ever experience."**~ Linda Lysakowski, ACFRE

VISIT HERE OR PRESS "GET STARTED" BELOW

 

https://jimmylarose.lt.acemlnd.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZub25wcm9maXRjb25mZXJlbmNlcy5vcmclMkY=&sig=BosQFU7ynmgD9spx2Ue428xQp8nb2iRVxQkwFPf62sSX&iat=1703086220&a=%7C%7C26605550%7C%7C&account=jimmylarose%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=cGWPyHaoVAymtuwKendX9l5gB9jPHTuDSCdWYgPR%3A7xdDVa4rc3ajeb4ojGBwcEaPTurnOAvo&s=678f48a0e320c6856d0620aa2e024acb&i=698A1169A214A2731 

 

"We grew our budget from $178,000 to $3.5 Million in 18 months using
